Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.43,0:00:05.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ataraxia Shop Channel!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.49,0:00:09.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Say Kizuna, I'm troubled.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.05,0:00:11.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong Julicia?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.04,0:00:15.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I would like some appropriate clothing for exercise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.22,0:00:17.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't there anything good out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.75,0:00:21.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have the perfect stuff for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.05,0:00:28.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The world famous Japanese cultural wear, Bloomers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.63,0:00:31.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Today we've got a limited run of only 150.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.37,0:00:36.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Japanese people always wear these when working out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.25,0:00:46.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amazing, this is so easy to move in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.79,0:00:50.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then let's show the people just how good it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.81,0:00:53.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,First the vault box.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.54,0:01:01.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.15,0:01:09.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hoola hoops.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.29,0:01:24.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.58,0:01:27.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Jump ropes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.47,0:01:35.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.05,0:01:38.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dance pole!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.02,0:01:46.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna slip!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.47,0:01:53.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.23,0:01:55.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can do any exercise with these.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.76,0:02:02.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,These can be yours for 6,880 yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.56,0:02:05.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Further, a special promo.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.51,0:02:13.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The vault box, hoola hoop, jump rope, and dance pole will come free!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.00,0:02:15.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow, that is so nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.39,0:02:17.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I wish there were something more exciting.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.85,0:02:20.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Man you are so greedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.03,0:02:22.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then let's put this on as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.91,0:02:24.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Triangle wooden horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.70,0:02:29.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you order within 30 minutes after this show, then we will send it to you for free.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.43,0:02:35.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It massages your crotch and thus makes you healthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.52,0:02:50.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ataraxia Shop Channel!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.34,0:02:57.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Say Kizuna, I am troubled.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.37,0:03:02.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know already, you want this don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.06,0:03:06.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The best for swimming, a school swimsuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.99,0:03:10.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now for a special price of 9800 yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.29,0:03:14.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And this is the classical type.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.42,0:03:19.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It fits me perfectly and it is so easy to swim in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.08,0:03:23.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And now let's give a bit of trivia.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.61,0:03:25.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.15,0:03:27.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.73,0:03:30.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why is the crotch part not connected?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.93,0:03:35.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't it to expel water that entered through the chest?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.28,0:03:37.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, that is not why.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.19,0:03:46.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop touching me there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.61,0:03:52.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was made so that I can touch you like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.65,0:03:58.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everyone's watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.79,0:04:05.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Its ok, no one is watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.53,0:04:12.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No way! Don't touch there!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.39,0:04:15.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.33,0:04:16.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's go! {- __ -}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.49,0:04:25.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am going to leak.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.10,0:04:35.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's all for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.55,0:04:38.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've got more amazing things lined up tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.40,0:04:41.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Female sushi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.32,0:04:43.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's for tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.83,0:04:49.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What kind of mystery is this?

